.TH VIEW 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
view \- Redraw your map view
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B view
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Redraw the map view of your surroundings. The view is drawn automatically
when you log in; this command draws it again on demand, for example after
your client lost track of the screen.
.PP
The view shows the tiles around you as the engine sees them: walls, doors,
players, creatures and things placed by the world and its modules.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR look,here (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
